# Build context for web/Dockerfile is the repo root (the npm workspace
# lockfile lives there). BuildKit reads this file instead of /.dockerignore
# when building with `-f web/Dockerfile`. Allowlist: the web workspace, the
# manifests npm ci needs, and the entrypoint — nothing else.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!backend/package.json
!web
!deploy/web
**/node_modules
web/.next
web/.env
web/.env.*
!web/.env.example
web/e2e/.results
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
web/prisma/seed/verify/__pycache__
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
